          "requirement": "Exercise the decoder’s rewritten gamma LUT behavior for RGBA8 by enabling SPNG_DECODE_USE_GAMA on the existing decode operation.",
          "target_route": "A finite 1×1 RGB8 PNG containing an IHDR, a four-byte gAMA chunk, a compressed one-pixel IDAT scanline and an IEND passes the harness’s size checks. Parsing stores gamma state; decode with the gamma flag would initialize and use the local LUT.",
